    "checkpoint_rule": "Assert only checkpoints with step <= length. These apply in every cycle; origins are ignored. Every cycle consumes P01..P(note_count) without a page reset. First NOTE is P01/note25; use the per-length first transitions below. Exit cursor is before the next cycle reset.",
